        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS333, Solid Brass Rectangular Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana made solid brass doorbell button has a new contemporary design with a stepped side. Offering both fashion and function, it features a modern 3-1/4 inches long by 1-1/4 inches wide rectangular shape with exposed screw mounting for an industrial chic look. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"248\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS333-Specifications.gif?v=1704354583\" width=\"248\" height=\"230\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS333 Contemporary Rectangular Doorbell Button Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BBS333 Contemporary Rectangular Doorbell Button:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Contemporary Doorbell Button, Deltana BBS333",
                "description": "Rectangular Doorbell Button Deltana BBS333 - This Deltana made solid brass doorbell button has a new contemporary design with a stepped side. Offering both fashion and function, it features a modern 3-1/4 inches long by 1-1/4 inches wide rectangular shape with exposed screw mounting for an industrial chic look. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. Available in 8 different finish choices.",
